rentemester-update verify --package CANDIDATE.app --trusted-key INDEPENDENT_RAW32_PUBLIC_KEY
rentemester-update status --installed INSTALLED.app --trusted-key PUBLIC_KEY
rentemester-update apply --package CANDIDATE.app --installed INSTALLED.app --trusted-key PUBLIC_KEY --confirm
rentemester-update recover --installed INSTALLED.app --trusted-key PUBLIC_KEY --confirm
Close the app first. Existing installation must already have an authenticated manifest. No network, workspace access, schema migration or automatic rollback. After an interrupted operation inspect status, then explicitly recover; never blindly replay apply. Apple signing/notarization remains a separate release gate.
